# PHPStan configuration for tests/ directory
#
# Level 9 is not achievable due to fundamental PHPUnit testing patterns:
# 1. missingType.iterableValue: Test factory methods (e.g., detailResponse(),
#    albumsResponse()) return `array` without `@template` annotations.
# 2. missingType.generics: Async test helpers use PromiseInterface without T.
# 3. staticMethod.alreadyNarrowedType: PHPUnit assertions on already-narrowed types.
#
# Level 2 is used as baseline. As of S448 the leg is GREEN — 0 findings.
#
# S448 (2026-09-08): this config existed in the tree but NO CI job ever ran it,
# so its findings were invisible. Wiring it up surfaced 9 findings, all now fixed:
#
#   - 6 x property.notFound (Model::$cols/$rows/$ended/$error, Msg::$item) —
#       root cause: the vendor `SugarCraft\Core\Model`/`Msg` are INTERFACES, and
#       PHPStan 2.2.x ignores `@property`/`@property-read` on an interface unless
#       it declares a native `__get()` (a stub-declared `__get()` is not native).
#       The old `@property` tags in phpstan.stubs.php were therefore DEAD — the
#       reason the self-comment below once claimed these "don't merge". Fixed at
#       the test boundary WITHOUT weakening assertions: concrete-class narrowing via
#       self::assertInstanceOf(LoginScreen/Player/SettingsScreen::class, ...) and a
#       `@template T of Msg` on PlayerScreenTest::firstOfType() so `$advance?->item`
#       sees the real property. No ignoreErrors, no baseline.
#   - 1 x phpDoc.parseError (MusicStoreTest:21) — `tracks:list<array>` (bare
#       `array`) breaks the phpdoc parser → `tracks:array<int,array<string,mixed>>`.
#   - 2 x parameter.phpDocType (SidebarTest:20, GateScanner.php:517) — a variadic
#       `@param list<string>` corrected to `string ...$names`; a `array{int,string,int}|string`
#       that is not a subtype of the native `array` corrected to the real parseExpr
#       3rd-element shape `array{headLiteralLine:?int,constNames:list<string>}`.

parameters:
    level: 2
    phpVersion: 80300
    paths:
        - tests
    tmpDir: .phpstan.cache
    bootstrapFiles:
        - vendor/autoload.php
    stubFiles:
        - phpstan.stubs.php
    excludePaths:
        # Exclude test stub/fixture files that aren't under test
        - tests/stub
        - tests/Reel/FakePlayerDecoder.php
        - tests/Reel/FakeAudioPlayer.php
        - tests/Graphics/KittyDecoder.php
        - tests/Graphics/Iterm2Decoder.php
        - tests/Graphics/SixelDecoder.php
